31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have a scary dream?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I slept well, thank you. Now, does anyone have information to share?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I do. I am the Seer, and I have found the werewolf. Rin is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,That was fast. A direct claim on the first day is quite bold.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, are you certain? Or are you the werewolf trying to eliminate a child?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! Mizuki, that's a mean lie! I'm just a little girl!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is a shocking accusation. However, if Mizuki is the Seer, the path is clear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I am certain. My divination was absolute. Rin is the werewolf.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the werewolf, she is playing the part of the innocent child perfectly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"It's a classic strategy. Either Mizuki is the Seer, or she's the werewolf framing Rin.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not a werewolf! Please believe me! Mizuki is being mean!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, why reveal yourself so early? It makes you a target for the werewolf tonight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Because the village cannot afford to waste a single day. We found the enemy immediately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Her confidence is convincing. It's a high-risk, high-reward play.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'm leaning toward believing Mizuki. The logic of a fake Seer attacking the most ""innocent"" person is risky.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,No! This isn't fair! I'm just Rin!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will trust the Seer's result. The evidence is direct.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I hope you all make the right choice for the village.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for Rin.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,I agree. Let's end this now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
